<title>USA: Roto-Rooter panel neutral on Chemed.</title>
<headline>Roto-Rooter panel neutral on Chemed.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A special board committee set up by Roto-Rooter said Tuesday it adopted a neutral position regarding the $41 per share offer made by Chemed Corp for the 42 percent stake it still does not own in Roto-Rooter.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Chemed said it took this position based on its conclusion that the offer price is &quot;fair&quot;.</p>
<p>The panel also concluded stockholders could be best able to determine whether to tender their shares based on their own circumstances.</p>
</text>
